-- Sharpness of Katz's divisibility for invariant derivatives on a CM formal
-- group: a limit to the divisibility of jets.
-- Source: grh-compact/src/New/Curve/KatzDivisibility.lean ("Known results
-- stated on this proof's data: Sharpness of Katz's divisibility for
-- invariant derivatives on a CM formal group. This file: Sharpness of
-- Katz's divisibility, by a multiplicative inequality between jets.";
